        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NecroKitty</strong> is fast-paced auto-runner with just two buttons.  Dash through a brutal changing level which demands precision and fast reflexes. Lose yourself in a gothic shadowscape while you achieve the ultimate reward for your hard work: Flow State.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two buttons: &quot;Attack&quot; and &quot;Jump&quot;.  Holding attack will speed up your character and activate a shield which protects you from certain enemies.  Jumping will catapult you to the ceiling and reverse your character's gravity.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels will keep you guessing and push your reaction time to its limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.poster.avif?t=1759530159\" width=400 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.webm?t=1759530159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.mp4?t=1759530159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NecroKitty</strong> is fast-paced auto-runner with just two buttons.  Dash through a brutal changing level which demands precision and fast reflexes. Lose yourself in a gothic shadowscape while you achieve the ultimate reward for your hard work: Flow State.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two buttons: &quot;Attack&quot; and &quot;Jump&quot;.  Holding attack will speed up your character and activate a shield which protects you from certain enemies.  Jumping will catapult you to the ceiling and reverse your character's gravity.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels will keep you guessing and push your reaction time to its limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.poster.avif?t=1759530159\" width=400 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.webm?t=1759530159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014400/extras/526a5b60b233f722afb998880a3e7b4d.mp4?t=1759530159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p>",
